OL,3,ACharlie Kirk's family alleges 'stunning
OL,4,Afailures' by Utah officials led to his
OL,5,Ashooting
OL,6,
OL,7,FCharlie Kirk's family has accused the
OL,8,FUtah Valley University and state
OL,9,Fofficials of "stunning failures and
OL,10,Freckless decisions" that they say led
OL,11,Fto the conservative activist's 2025
OL,12,Fassassination during a campus event.
OL,14,FIn a legal notice, lawyers for the
OL,15,Ffamily say Kirk's Turning Point USA
OL,16,Fevent at the university campus was not
OL,17,Fproperly secured or monitored, making
OL,18,Fhim an easy target.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
