OL,3,ACharlie Kirk's family alleges 'stunning
OL,4,Afailures' by Utah officials led to his
OL,5,Ashooting
OL,6,
OL,7,FKirk, 31, was speaking to a crowd of
OL,8,Fthousands on the university campus,
OL,9,Fwhen he was shot and killed by a gunman
OL,10,Fpositioned on a roof.
OL,12,FThe university said it was aware of the
OL,13,Fclaim but did not comment further on
OL,14,Fthe allegations, according to a
OL,15,Fstatement shared with the BBC's US
OL,16,Fpartner CBS News.
